{"seq":2,"slug":"coroutine-core-ideas","title":"协程的核心思想","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/coroutines/coroutine-core-ideas","wordCount":1431,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"协程的核心思想\">协程的核心思想</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>协程的设计思想可以归纳为三条：<strong>用户控制调度</strong>、<strong>协作式多任务</strong>与<strong>面向 I/O 的高吞吐</strong>。它们共同解释了为什么协程在 I/O 密集场景下能以极低资源处理海量并发。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>代价或风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>用户控制调度</strong></td>\n<td>绕过昂贵的内核态切换</td>\n<td>调度器需自行实现，单线程无法利用多核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>协作式多任务</strong></td>\n<td>明确挂起点、减少竞争</td>\n<td>不主动 yield 的协程会独占执行权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>I/O 高吞吐</strong></td>\n<td>I/O 等待期间 CPU 空转</td>\n<td>依赖底层异步 I/O 支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[&quot;协程的核心思想&quot;] --&gt; U[&quot;用户控制调度&lt;br/&gt;调度权从内核转移到用户空间&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; M[&quot;协作式多任务&lt;br/&gt;主动 yield / await 让出&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; I[&quot;I/O 密集型高吞吐&lt;br/&gt;等待时切换到其他协程&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt;|风险| S[&quot;不让出会导致其他协程饿死&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt;|收益| B[&quot;CPU 利用率大幅提升&quot;]\">graph TD\n  C[\"协程的核心思想\"] --&gt; U[\"用户控制调度&lt;br/&gt;调度权从内核转移到用户空间\"]\n  C --&gt; M[\"协作式多任务&lt;br/&gt;主动 yield / await 让出\"]\n  C --&gt; I[\"I/O 密集型高吞吐&lt;br/&gt;等待时切换到其他协程\"]\n  M --&gt;|风险| S[\"不让出会导致其他协程饿死\"]\n  I --&gt;|收益| B[\"CPU 利用率大幅提升\"]</pre><p>三条思想存在内在联系：正因为调度在用户态（思想一），才可能实现协作式切换（思想二）；正因为切换廉价且可在等待 I/O 时发生（思想二），I/O 密集场景的高吞吐（思想三）才得以实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户控制调度-绕过内核上下文切换\">用户控制调度：绕过内核上下文切换</h2><p>协程最核心的思想是将<strong>调度权从操作系统内核转移到用户程序</strong>。传统线程模型中，操作系统内核负责在多个线程之间分配 CPU 时间片，每次切换都需要进入内核态、保存/恢复完整的 CPU 上下文（寄存器、栈指针、程序计数器等），开销显著。</p>\n<p>协程则完全在用户空间完成切换，避免了昂贵的内核态陷入：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant ThreadA as Thread A&#10;    participant Kernel as OS Kernel&#10;    participant ThreadB as Thread B&#10;&#10;    ThreadA-&gt;&gt;Kernel: Time slice expired / System call&#10;    Note over Kernel: Save Thread A full context&lt;br/&gt;(registers, stack, page tables, etc.)&#10;    Kernel-&gt;&gt;ThreadB: Restore Thread B context&#10;    Note over Kernel: Context switch cost: ~1-10 microseconds\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant ThreadA as Thread A\n    participant Kernel as OS Kernel\n    participant ThreadB as Thread B\n\n    ThreadA-&gt;&gt;Kernel: Time slice expired / System call\n    Note over Kernel: Save Thread A full context&lt;br/&gt;(registers, stack, page tables, etc.)\n    Kernel-&gt;&gt;ThreadB: Restore Thread B context\n    Note over Kernel: Context switch cost: ~1-10 microseconds</pre><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant CoroA as Coroutine A&#10;    participant Scheduler as User-space Scheduler&#10;    participant CoroB as Coroutine B&#10;&#10;    CoroA-&gt;&gt;Scheduler: yield / await&#10;    Note over Scheduler: Save Coroutine A minimal state&lt;br/&gt;(program counter, local variables)&#10;    Scheduler-&gt;&gt;CoroB: Restore Coroutine B state&#10;    Note over Scheduler: Context switch cost: ~10-100 nanoseconds\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant CoroA as Coroutine A\n    participant Scheduler as User-space Scheduler\n    participant CoroB as Coroutine B\n\n    CoroA-&gt;&gt;Scheduler: yield / await\n    Note over Scheduler: Save Coroutine A minimal state&lt;br/&gt;(program counter, local variables)\n    Scheduler-&gt;&gt;CoroB: Restore Coroutine B state\n    Note over Scheduler: Context switch cost: ~10-100 nanoseconds</pre><p>两者的开销对比非常明显：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>线程上下文切换</th>\n<th>协程上下文切换</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>切换层级</td>\n<td>用户态 → 内核态 → 用户态</td>\n<td>仅用户态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保存内容</td>\n<td>全部 CPU 寄存器、栈、页表、FPU 状态</td>\n<td>程序计数器 + 少量局部变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型耗时</td>\n<td>1~10 微秒</td>\n<td>10~100 纳秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能差距</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>快 <strong>10~100 倍</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否触发系统调用</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"协作式多任务-主动让出控制权\">协作式多任务：主动让出控制权</h2><p>协程的第二个核心思想是<strong>协作式多任务（Cooperative Multitasking）</strong>。每个协程在执行过程中，必须在适当的时机主动调用 <code>yield</code> 或 <code>await</code> 来让出控制权，调度器才能切换到其他协程。</p>\n<p>这与操作系统的抢占式调度形成了鲜明对比：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Preemptive Scheduling&#10;        direction TB&#10;        P1[&quot;Thread A Executing&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Timer Interrupt&lt;br/&gt;(Forced Switch)&quot;| P2[&quot;OS Saves A&#39;s Context&quot;]&#10;        P2 --&gt; P3[&quot;OS Restores B&#39;s Context&quot;]&#10;        P3 --&gt; P4[&quot;Thread B Executing&quot;]&#10;        P4 --&gt;|&quot;Timer Interrupt&lt;br/&gt;(Forced Switch)&quot;| P5[&quot;OS Saves B&#39;s Context&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Cooperative Scheduling&#10;        direction TB&#10;        C1[&quot;Coroutine A Executing&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;yield&lt;br/&gt;(Voluntary Yield)&quot;| C2[&quot;Scheduler Saves A&#39;s State&quot;]&#10;        C2 --&gt; C3[&quot;Scheduler Restores B&#39;s State&quot;]&#10;        C3 --&gt; C4[&quot;Coroutine B Executing&quot;]&#10;        C4 --&gt;|&quot;await I/O&lt;br/&gt;(Voluntary Yield)&quot;| C5[&quot;Scheduler Saves B&#39;s State&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Preemptive Scheduling\n        direction TB\n        P1[\"Thread A Executing\"] --&gt;|\"Timer Interrupt&lt;br/&gt;(Forced Switch)\"| P2[\"OS Saves A's Context\"]\n        P2 --&gt; P3[\"OS Restores B's Context\"]\n        P3 --&gt; P4[\"Thread B Executing\"]\n        P4 --&gt;|\"Timer Interrupt&lt;br/&gt;(Forced Switch)\"| P5[\"OS Saves B's Context\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Cooperative Scheduling\n        direction TB\n        C1[\"Coroutine A Executing\"] --&gt;|\"yield&lt;br/&gt;(Voluntary Yield)\"| C2[\"Scheduler Saves A's State\"]\n        C2 --&gt; C3[\"Scheduler Restores B's State\"]\n        C3 --&gt; C4[\"Coroutine B Executing\"]\n        C4 --&gt;|\"await I/O&lt;br/&gt;(Voluntary Yield)\"| C5[\"Scheduler Saves B's State\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"协作式调度的优势\">协作式调度的优势</h3><p>主动让出机制带来了一系列重要优势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>可预测性</strong></td>\n<td>程序员明确知道切换发生在哪里，逻辑更清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>减少竞争</strong></td>\n<td>yield 点之间的代码不会被中断，天然减少数据竞争</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>无需加锁</strong></td>\n<td>在同一线程内的协程切换，共享数据访问通常不需要锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>调试友好</strong></td>\n<td>执行流程可控，比多线程更容易调试和推理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"协作式调度的风险\">协作式调度的风险</h3><p>协作式调度也有其风险：如果某个协程不主动 yield，它将<strong>独占执行权</strong>，其他协程永远无法运行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// ❌ 危险：协程不让出控制权&#10;协程 badCoroutine():&#10;    while true:&#10;        heavyComputation()     // 永远不 yield&#10;        // 其他协程全部饿死！&#10;&#10;// ✅ 正确：在适当位置让出&#10;协程 goodCoroutine():&#10;    while true:&#10;        doSomeWork()&#10;        yield                  // 定期让出，让其他协程有机会运行\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 危险：协程不让出控制权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>协程 badCoroutine():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while true:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        heavyComputation()     // 永远不 yield</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 其他协程全部饿死！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 正确：在适当位置让出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>协程 goodCoroutine():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while true:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        doSomeWork()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        yield                  // 定期让出，让其他协程有机会运行</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Normal Cooperation&#10;        direction TB&#10;        N1[&quot;Coroutine A: Work&quot;] --&gt; N2[&quot;Coroutine A: yield&quot;]&#10;        N2 --&gt; N3[&quot;Coroutine B: Work&quot;]&#10;        N3 --&gt; N4[&quot;Coroutine B: yield&quot;]&#10;        N4 --&gt; N5[&quot;Coroutine C: Work&quot;]&#10;        N5 --&gt; N6[&quot;Coroutine C: yield&quot;]&#10;        N6 --&gt; N1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Starvation Problem&#10;        direction TB&#10;        S1[&quot;Coroutine A: Infinite Loop&lt;br/&gt;Never yields&quot;] --&gt; S2[&quot;Coroutine B: Waiting...&quot;]&#10;        S2 --&gt; S3[&quot;Coroutine C: Waiting...&quot;]&#10;        S3 -.-&gt;|&quot;Can never execute&quot;| S2&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Normal Cooperation\n        direction TB\n        N1[\"Coroutine A: Work\"] --&gt; N2[\"Coroutine A: yield\"]\n        N2 --&gt; N3[\"Coroutine B: Work\"]\n        N3 --&gt; N4[\"Coroutine B: yield\"]\n        N4 --&gt; N5[\"Coroutine C: Work\"]\n        N5 --&gt; N6[\"Coroutine C: yield\"]\n        N6 --&gt; N1\n    end\n    subgraph Starvation Problem\n        direction TB\n        S1[\"Coroutine A: Infinite Loop&lt;br/&gt;Never yields\"] --&gt; S2[\"Coroutine B: Waiting...\"]\n        S2 --&gt; S3[\"Coroutine C: Waiting...\"]\n        S3 -.-&gt;|\"Can never execute\"| S2\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"i-o-密集型场景的高吞吐\">I/O 密集型场景的高吞吐</h2><p>协程最大的价值体现在 <strong>I/O 密集型任务</strong>中。在这类任务中，程序的大部分时间都在等待外部操作完成（网络请求、磁盘读写、数据库查询等），CPU 实际上处于空闲状态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"传统同步模型的浪费\">传统同步模型的浪费</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 传统同步模型：线程在 I/O 期间被阻塞&#10;函数 handleRequest(request):&#10;    data = 读取数据库(request.query)     // 阻塞等待 ~5ms&#10;    template = 读取文件(&quot;template.html&quot;) // 阻塞等待 ~2ms&#10;    result = 渲染模板(template, data)    // CPU 计算 ~0.1ms&#10;    return result&#10;&#10;// 总耗时 ≈ 7.1ms，其中 CPU 实际工作仅 0.1ms&#10;// CPU 利用率 ≈ 1.4%\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 传统同步模型：线程在 I/O 期间被阻塞</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>函数 handleRequest(request):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data = 读取数据库(request.query)     // 阻塞等待 ~5ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    template = 读取文件(\"template.html\") // 阻塞等待 ~2ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = 渲染模板(template, data)    // CPU 计算 ~0.1ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 总耗时 ≈ 7.1ms，其中 CPU 实际工作仅 0.1ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// CPU 利用率 ≈ 1.4%</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"协程的异步-i-o-模型\">协程的异步 I/O 模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 协程模型：I/O 等待期间切换到其他协程&#10;协程 handleRequest(request):&#10;    data = await 读取数据库(request.query)     // 让出，切换到其他协程&#10;    template = await 读取文件(&quot;template.html&quot;) // 让出，切换到其他协程&#10;    result = 渲染模板(template, data)          // CPU 计算&#10;    return result&#10;&#10;// 等待 I/O 的同时，其他协程可以利用 CPU&#10;// CPU 利用率大幅提升\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 协程模型：I/O 等待期间切换到其他协程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>协程 handleRequest(request):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data = await 读取数据库(request.query)     // 让出，切换到其他协程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    template = await 读取文件(\"template.html\") // 让出，切换到其他协程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = 渲染模板(template, data)          // CPU 计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 等待 I/O 的同时，其他协程可以利用 CPU</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// CPU 利用率大幅提升</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C1 as Coroutine 1&#10;    participant C2 as Coroutine 2&#10;    participant C3 as Coroutine 3&#10;    participant IO as I/O Subsystem&#10;&#10;    C1-&gt;&gt;IO: await Read Database&#10;    Note over C1: Suspended&#10;    C2-&gt;&gt;C2: Render Template (CPU Work)&#10;    C2-&gt;&gt;IO: await Read File&#10;    Note over C2: Suspended&#10;    C3-&gt;&gt;C3: Process Request (CPU Work)&#10;    IO--&gt;&gt;C1: Database Returns Result&#10;    Note over C1: Resumed&#10;    C1-&gt;&gt;C1: Continue Processing&#10;    IO--&gt;&gt;C2: File Read Complete&#10;    Note over C2: Resumed&#10;    C2-&gt;&gt;C2: Continue Processing\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C1 as Coroutine 1\n    participant C2 as Coroutine 2\n    participant C3 as Coroutine 3\n    participant IO as I/O Subsystem\n\n    C1-&gt;&gt;IO: await Read Database\n    Note over C1: Suspended\n    C2-&gt;&gt;C2: Render Template (CPU Work)\n    C2-&gt;&gt;IO: await Read File\n    Note over C2: Suspended\n    C3-&gt;&gt;C3: Process Request (CPU Work)\n    IO--&gt;&gt;C1: Database Returns Result\n    Note over C1: Resumed\n    C1-&gt;&gt;C1: Continue Processing\n    IO--&gt;&gt;C2: File Read Complete\n    Note over C2: Resumed\n    C2-&gt;&gt;C2: Continue Processing</pre><h3 id=\"吞吐量对比\">吞吐量对比</h3><p>假设有 1000 个并发请求，每个请求的 I/O 等待时间为 5ms，CPU 处理时间为 0.1ms：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>线程模型（1000 线程）</th>\n<th>协程模型（1000 协程）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存消耗</td>\n<td>~1 GB（每线程 ~1MB）</td>\n<td>~4 MB（每协程 ~4KB）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文切换</td>\n<td>~1000 次内核切换</td>\n<td>~1000 次用户态切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切换总开销</td>\n<td>~5ms</td>\n<td>~0.05ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 利用率</td>\n<td>低（大量时间在等待 I/O）</td>\n<td>高（I/O 等待时执行其他协程）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>理论吞吐量</td>\n<td>受线程数和切换开销限制</td>\n<td>接近 I/O 子系统的理论上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"yield-与-await-的语义\">yield 与 await 的语义</h2><p>协程通过 <code>yield</code> 和 <code>await</code> 两个关键操作实现挂起和恢复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>yield</code></td>\n<td>主动让出控制权，可附带返回值</td>\n<td>生成器、惰性序列、手动调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>await</code></td>\n<td>等待异步操作完成，期间让出控制权</td>\n<td>异步 I/O、网络请求、定时器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// yield：生成器模式，按需产出值&#10;function* fibonacci(): Generator&lt;number&gt; {&#10;  let a = 0;&#10;  let b = 1;&#10;  while (true) {&#10;    yield a;&#10;    [a, b] = [b, a + b];&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;const fib = fibonacci();&#10;console.log(fib.next().value); // 0&#10;console.log(fib.next().value); // 1&#10;console.log(fib.next().value); // 1&#10;console.log(fib.next().value); // 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// yield：生成器模式，按需产出值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fibonacci</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Generator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    yield</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [a, b] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [b, a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fib</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fibonacci</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fib.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().value); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fib.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().value); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fib.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().value); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fib.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().value); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// await：异步等待模式&#10;async function fetchData(url: string): Promise&lt;string&gt; {&#10;  const response = await fetch(url);&#10;  const data = await response.text();&#10;  return data;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// await：异步等待模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Coroutine Starts Execution&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;Encounter yield / await?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;No&quot;| C[&quot;Continue Executing Next Instruction&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;yield&quot;| D[&quot;Save Current State&lt;br/&gt;Return yield value to Caller&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;await&quot;| E[&quot;Save Current State&lt;br/&gt;Register Callback with I/O System&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;Wait for Caller to resume&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;Wait for I/O Completion&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;Resume Execution&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Coroutine Starts Execution\"] --&gt; B{\"Encounter yield / await?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"No\"| C[\"Continue Executing Next Instruction\"]\n    C --&gt; B\n    B --&gt;|\"yield\"| D[\"Save Current State&lt;br/&gt;Return yield value to Caller\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"await\"| E[\"Save Current State&lt;br/&gt;Register Callback with I/O System\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"Wait for Caller to resume\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"Wait for I/O Completion\"]\n    F --&gt; H[\"Resume Execution\"]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; B</pre><h2 id=\"协程与回调的对比\">协程与回调的对比</h2><p>在协程出现之前，异步编程通常依赖<strong>回调函数（Callback）</strong>。协程的引入使得异步代码可以用接近同步的方式书写：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 回调地狱：嵌套深、难以维护&#10;function loadUserData(userId: string, callback: (data: any) =&gt; void) {&#10;  fetchUser(userId, (user) =&gt; {&#10;    fetchOrders(user.id, (orders) =&gt; {&#10;      fetchProducts(orders[0].productId, (product) =&gt; {&#10;        callback({ user, orders, product });&#10;      });&#10;    });&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 协程风格：扁平、清晰、易于理解&#10;async function loadUserData(userId: string) {&#10;  const user = await fetchUser(userId);&#10;  const orders = await fetchOrders(user.id);&#10;  const product = await fetchProducts(orders[0].productId);&#10;  return { user, orders, product };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 回调地狱：嵌套深、难以维护</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadUserData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">callback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    fetchOrders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user.id, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      fetchProducts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orders[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].productId, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        callback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ user, orders, product });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 协程风格：扁平、清晰、易于理解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadUserData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchOrders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user.id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchProducts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orders[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].productId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { user, orders, product };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>回调模式</th>\n<th>协程模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代码结构</td>\n<td>深层嵌套（回调地狱）</td>\n<td>扁平化、线性结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n<td>每层回调需单独处理错误</td>\n<td>try/catch 统一处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可读性</td>\n<td>低，逻辑分散</td>\n<td>高，接近同步代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可维护性</td>\n<td>难以修改和重构</td>\n<td>易于修改和重构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制流</td>\n<td>难以实现循环、条件等复杂控制流</td>\n<td>自然支持所有控制流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>协程的第一核心思想是<strong>用户控制调度</strong>，将调度权从内核转移到用户空间，避免昂贵的内核态上下文切换，性能提升 10~100 倍。</li>\n<li>协程的第二核心思想是<strong>协作式多任务</strong>，协程通过主动 yield/await 让出控制权，使得 yield 点之间的代码天然不会被中断。</li>\n<li>协程的最大价值在于 <strong>I/O 密集型场景</strong>，在等待 I/O 期间切换到其他协程执行，极大提升 CPU 利用率和系统吞吐量。</li>\n<li><code>yield</code> 用于主动让出并返回值（生成器模式），<code>await</code> 用于等待异步操作完成。</li>\n<li>协程使得异步代码可以用<strong>接近同步的方式</strong>书写，从根本上解决了回调地狱问题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协程的核心思想","id":"协程的核心思想"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"用户控制调度：绕过内核上下文切换","id":"用户控制调度-绕过内核上下文切换"},{"level":2,"text":"协作式多任务：主动让出控制权","id":"协作式多任务-主动让出控制权"},{"level":3,"text":"协作式调度的优势","id":"协作式调度的优势"},{"level":3,"text":"协作式调度的风险","id":"协作式调度的风险"},{"level":2,"text":"I/O 密集型场景的高吞吐","id":"i-o-密集型场景的高吞吐"},{"level":3,"text":"传统同步模型的浪费","id":"传统同步模型的浪费"},{"level":3,"text":"协程的异步 I/O 模型","id":"协程的异步-i-o-模型"},{"level":3,"text":"吞吐量对比","id":"吞吐量对比"},{"level":2,"text":"yield 与 await 的语义","id":"yield-与-await-的语义"},{"level":2,"text":"协程与回调的对比","id":"协程与回调的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"协程的定义与核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/coroutines/coroutine-definition-and-concepts"},"next":{"title":"协程的实现机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/coroutines/coroutine-implementation"}}